atement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:67d0a930df2a8584b10a8bff164dc88faeb37e97e76a92227015315b9d704a5b","file":"preprints/Scale-and-conformal-symmetry-in-four-dimensional-operational-quantum-field-theory-September-26-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":56,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"bd7c3a39f91d2684cfd649e9a6bec7114630571deb0c05fb0f2421e8c02b6f8a","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Scale-and-conformal-symmetry-in-four-dimensional-operational-quantum-field-theory-September-26-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:67d0a930df2a8584b10a8bff164dc88faeb37e97e76a92227015315b9d704a5b","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Scale-and-conformal-symmetry-in-four-dimensional-operational-quantum-field-theory-September-26-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L56"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nSuppose Assumption~\\ref{ass:framework} holds, including the algebraic\ndirect-sum decomposition with finite scaling support for every original\nfield. Then the physical stress tensor admits a local symmetric conserved\nimprovement with the same translation and Lorentz Ward charges and with\nzero trace. More precisely, let $T^{(4)}$ and $V^{(3)}$\nbe the Hermitian dimension-four and dimension-three components selected\nby the affine Ward identities. There is a Hermitian physical scalar\nfield $L$ of dimension two such that\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:intro-improvement}\n \\partial^\\mu V^{(3)}_\\mu=\\Box L,\n \\qquad\n t_{\\mu\\nu}=T^{(4)}_{\\mu\\nu}\n       +\\frac13(\\partial_\\mu\\partial_\\nu-\\eta_{\\mu\\nu}\\Box)L\n\\end{equation}\nis symmetric, conserved and traceless. The replacement $T\\mapsto T^{(4)}$ also preserves the affine charges. The currents $X^\\nu t_{\\mu\\nu}$ for conformal Killing vector fields $X$ have unbroken local Ward identities on the physical field algebra, extending its Poincar\\'e and dilation actions."}
